{
  "format": "astro-canvas/workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "rbcodes-redshift-finder",
  "name": "Redshift Finder",
  "description": "rbcodes rb_zfind as a workflow: an SDSS star-forming galaxy (z = 0.0059) searched with the picket fence, the line search and a MARZ template, plus an SDSS quasar (z = 3.01) searched with the QSO line list; Rank and Accept turns the candidates into a Redshift that Set Redshift consumes.",
  "nodes": {
    "load_gal": {
      "type": "core.io.load_spectrum",
      "title": "SDSS galaxy (z = 0.0059)",
      "pos": [
        40,
        120
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "samples/rbcodes/spec-0398-51789-0282.fits"
      }
    },
    "lines_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.curated_linelist",
      "title": "Galaxy lines",
      "pos": [
        40,
        380
      ],
      "params": {
        "name": "zfind_galaxy"
      }
    },
    "pf_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.picket_fence_search",
      "title": "Picket fence (galaxy)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        40
      ],
      "params": {
        "z_min": 0.0,
        "z_max": 0.5,
        "n_steps": 3000,
        "smooth_fwhm_pix": 2.0,
        "fwhm_ang": 3.0
      }
    },
    "ls_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.line_search",
      "title": "Line search (galaxy)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        340
      ],
      "params": {
        "z_min": 0.0,
        "z_max": 0.5,
        "n_steps": 3000
      }
    },
    "tpl_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.template_search",
      "title": "Template (late-type)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        640
      ],
      "params": {
        "template_name": "LateTypeEmission",
        "z_min": 0.0,
        "z_max": 0.5,
        "n_steps": 2000
      }
    },
    "pca_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.pca_search",
      "title": "PCA (galaxy, press Run)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        940
      ],
      "params": {
        "template_set": "galaxy",
        "z_min": 0.0,
        "z_max": 0.5,
        "n_steps": 1000
      }
    },
    "rank_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.rank",
      "title": "Rank and accept (galaxy)",
      "pos": [
        800,
        240
      ],
      "params": {
        "accepted": null
      }
    },
    "zshift_gal": {
      "type": "rbcodes.absorption.set_redshift",
      "title": "Galaxy rest frame",
      "pos": [
        1160,
        120
      ],
      "params": {
        "z": 0.0
      }
    },
    "load_qso": {
      "type": "core.io.load_spectrum",
      "title": "SDSS quasar (z = 3.01)",
      "pos": [
        40,
        1300
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "samples/rbcodes/sdss1.fits"
      }
    },
    "lines_qso": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.curated_linelist",
      "title": "QSO lines",
      "pos": [
        40,
        1560
      ],
      "params": {
        "name": "zfind_qso"
      }
    },
    "pf_qso": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.picket_fence_search",
      "title": "Picket fence (QSO)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        1300
      ],
      "params": {
        "z_min": 0.0,
        "z_max": 5.0,
        "n_steps": 5000,
        "smooth_fwhm_pix": 3.0,
        "fwhm_ang": 20.0
      }
    },
    "rank_qso": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.rank",
      "title": "Rank and accept (QSO)",
      "pos": [
        800,
        1300
      ],
      "params": {
        "accepted": null
      }
    },
    "zshift_qso": {
      "type": "rbcodes.absorption.set_redshift",
      "title": "QSO rest frame",
      "pos": [
        1160,
        1300
      ],
      "params": {
        "z": 0.0
      }
    },
    "readme": {
      "type": "core.note.markdown",
      "pos": [
        800,
        640
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        320
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "# Redshift finder\n\nThe `rb_zfind` engine as nodes.\n\n1. **Load** the SDSS star-forming galaxy `spec-0398-51789-0282.fits` (pipeline z = 0.00586) and pick the **Curated Line List** `zfind_galaxy`.\n2. Three searches run on it: the weighted **Picket Fence**, the plain **Line Search** and a MARZ **Template Search** (late-type emission galaxy). The **PCA Search** is expensive: press Run on it to see progress and cancellation in the process pool.\n3. **Rank and Accept** collects their candidates; open its editor (pencil-ruler button) to click a candidate on the curve, check the line list overlaid on the spectrum, and Apply. Its `redshift` output drives **Set Redshift**.\n4. The same for the quasar `sdss1.fits` (z = 3.0133) with `zfind_qso`.\n\nEvery curve is a score where minima are the best redshifts (chi-square for templates/PCA)."
      }
    }
  },
  "edges": {
    "e1": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "pf_gal",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e2": {
      "from": [
        "lines_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "pf_gal",
        "linelist"
      ]
    },
    "e3": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "ls_gal",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e4": {
      "from": [
        "lines_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "ls_gal",
        "linelist"
      ]
    },
    "e5": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "tpl_gal",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e6": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "pca_gal",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e7": {
      "from": [
        "pf_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "rank_gal",
        "results"
      ]
    },
    "e8": {
      "from": [
        "ls_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "rank_gal",
        "results_2"
      ]
    },
    "e9": {
      "from": [
        "tpl_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "rank_gal",
        "results_3"
      ]
    },
    "e10": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "zshift_gal",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e11": {
      "from": [
        "rank_gal",
        "redshift"
      ],
      "to": [
        "zshift_gal",
        "redshift"
      ]
    },
    "e12": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "pf_qso",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e13": {
      "from": [
        "lines_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "pf_qso",
        "linelist"
      ]
    },
    "e14": {
      "from": [
        "pf_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "rank_qso",
        "results"
      ]
    },
    "e15": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "zshift_qso",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e16": {
      "from": [
        "rank_qso",
        "redshift"
      ],
      "to": [
        "zshift_qso",
        "redshift"
      ]
    }
  },
  "views": [
    {
      "id": "curve",
      "node": "pf_gal",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "zfind-curve"
    },
    {
      "id": "spectrum",
      "node": "load_gal",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "spectrum-thumb"
    },
    {
      "id": "candidates",
      "node": "rank_gal",
      "port": "candidates",
      "kind": "candidates-table"
    },
    {
      "id": "qso_curve",
      "node": "pf_qso",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "zfind-curve"
    },
    {
      "id": "qso_candidates",
      "node": "rank_qso",
      "port": "candidates",
      "kind": "candidates-table"
    }
  ],
  "requires": {
    "packs": {
      "astro-canvas-core": ">=0.1,<0.2",
      "astro-canvas-rbcodes": ">=0.1,<0.2"
    },
    "python": ">=3.10"
  },
  "meta": {
    "author": "rbcodes pack",
    "tags": [
      "template",
      "rbcodes",
      "redshift",
      "zfind"
    ],
    "default_layout": "dashboard"
  },
  "promoted": [
    {
      "node": "load_gal",
      "param": "path",
      "label": "Spectrum",
      "group": "Load",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "node": "lines_gal",
      "param": "name",
      "label": "Line list",
      "group": "Load",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "node": "pf_gal",
      "param": "z_min",
      "label": "z min",
      "group": "Search",
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "node": "pf_gal",
      "param": "z_max",
      "label": "z max",
      "group": "Search",
      "order": 4
    },
    {
      "node": "pf_gal",
      "param": "n_steps",
      "label": "Steps",
      "group": "Search",
      "order": 5
    },
    {
      "node": "rank_gal",
      "param": "accepted",
      "label": "Accepted candidate",
      "group": "Accept",
      "order": 6
    }
  ],
  "layouts": {
    "dashboard": {
      "cols": 12,
      "row_height": 48,
      "items": [
        {
          "ref": "view:curve",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 7,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:candidates",
          "x": 7,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 5,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:spectrum",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:pf_gal.z_min",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:pf_gal.z_max",
          "x": 3,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:pf_gal.n_steps",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:rank_gal.accepted",
          "x": 9,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:qso_curve",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 8,
          "w": 7,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:qso_candidates",
          "x": 7,
          "y": 8,
          "w": 5,
          "h": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    "app": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Load",
          "items": [
            "promoted:load_gal.path",
            "promoted:lines_gal.name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Search",
          "items": [
            "promoted:pf_gal.z_min",
            "promoted:pf_gal.z_max",
            "promoted:pf_gal.n_steps"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept",
          "items": [
            "promoted:rank_gal.accepted"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Results",
          "items": [
            "view:curve",
            "view:candidates",
            "view:spectrum"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
